 <section class="section research"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">My Approach</p><h2>From concept to the workbench.</h2></div></div><div class="approach-grid">
  <article><h3>Design around the hardware</h3><p>Use CAD, component measurements, and assembly constraints to develop mechanisms and interfaces that can be built and checked.</p></article>
  <article><h3>Bring the pieces together</h3><p>Connect mechanical parts, electronics, sensors, and software into systems that work together, then troubleshoot the interfaces.</p></article>
  <article><h3>Test and refine</h3><p>Use observations and measurements to understand behavior, identify what needs to change, and guide the next iteration.</p></article>
